{
  "$comment": "Artist-inspired production profiles from JON_HOPKINS.md and TINLICKER.md. Numbers are the documents' own; where a document leaves something open the assumption is recorded beside it. These are production grammars for original music - never melodies, harmonies or arrangements to copy.",
  "version": 1,
