      "mix_audit": ["kick and bass are individually clear", "kick and bass become stronger together", "low bass is mono-compatible", "primary hook is obvious", "no unnecessary competing melody", "percussion has movement", "pads do not cloud the low mids", "reverb returns are EQ'd", "important vocals remain intelligible", "arrangement changes meaningfully over time", "breakdown has genuine contrast", "drop has physical impact", "stereo image survives mono", "top end is not brittle", "automation is audible but not gimmicky", "master retains transient movement"],
      "anti_patterns": {
